<title>SINGAPORE: Datacraft full year net up 32.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Datacraft full year net up 32.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of US$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    9.08  vs   6.86</p>
<p>    EPS (cts)		     5.0   vs   4.5</p>
<p>    EPS fully diluted (cts)   4.9   vs   4.4</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cts)	0.73  vs   NA</p>
<p>    Turnover		    116.09  vs  91.45</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)	  0.31  vs   0.44</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortization 3.02  vs   2.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     11.03  vs   8.89</p>
<p>    Tax			     1.88  vs   1.97</p>
<p>    Minorities (expense)	0.06  vs   0.06</p>
<p>    Dividend pay/register:   TBA</p>
<p>Note - Datacraft Asia Ltd is a communications and network systems integrator.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
